    "updated_at": "2020-11-20T16:12:37Z",
    "body": "@sidmadala, the config variable needs to contain the filename (including the path) for the Starship configuration. Could you please try out the following, if you placed the `starship.toml` in the `$HOME/.config/starship` directory:\r\n\r\n```bash\r\nexport STARSHIP_CONFIG=\"$HOME/.config/starship/starship.toml\"\r\neval \"$(starship init zsh)\"\r\n```",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
